        "evidence": "This image is genuine and unmodified -- a real capture of the real crash, not a harness failure (the harness ran to completion and the blankness validator correctly passed it, since a crash screen is not blank). features[] is deliberately left empty: this capture shows none of the Settings screen real content, so it evidences nothing about app-display-name or any other Settings feature. This is a real regression introduced somewhere in the seven feature lanes merged at or before this capture run commit and needs a source-level fix outside this recapture lane scope (docs/features/uh-completeness/captures/** and scripts/capture/** only)."
      }
